# International Digital Library Information: Special Emphasis on Advances in Developing Countries (SIG III)

**Authors:** Leroy, Natalie, Piggott, Sylvia

## Abstract
Describes plans for a technical session that included presentations of six winning papers on practical collaborative applications of digital library or information science technology in advancing communications in developing countries. Papers were all written by citizens of a developing country and were selected from an international competition. (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ618421

